  Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 (CC-BY 4.0), see assets/emoji/LICENSE-Twemoji.txt.
  https://github.com/jdecked/twemoji. Resized to 32x32 and palette-reduced for VivoTube.
- RapidJSON (third_party/rapidjson/): MIT License, see its license file
- Mozilla CA certificate bundle (assets/cacert.pem): Mozilla Public License 2.0
- HarfBuzz (linked into eboot.bin): the MIT-style "Old MIT" license, see
  https://github.com/harfbuzz/harfbuzz/blob/main/COPYING
- GNU FriBidi (linked into eboot.bin): GNU Lesser General Public License 2.1 or later, see
  https://github.com/fribidi/fribidi/blob/master/COPYING. VivoTube's complete source code and
  build scripts are published, so the program can be relinked against a modified FriBidi.
- libcurl, mbedTLS, zlib, zstd, libvita2d, libjpeg-turbo, FreeType and libpng (linked into
  eboot.bin from VitaSDK packages): their own licenses
